1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,800
Welcome to this offline listening practice.
欢迎来到本节离线听力练习。

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,200
Today we are going to talk about why small habits matter more than big plans.
今天我们要聊的是，为什么小习惯比宏大的计划更重要。

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,400
When you repeat a simple action every single day, it quietly changes the way you think.
当你每天重复一个简单的动作，它会悄然改变你的思维方式。

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:17,000
So instead of waiting for motivation, build a system that works even on your worst days.
与其等待动力降临，不如建立一个即使在你状态最差时也能运转的系统。
